      "created_at": "2012-11-17T21:17:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The general way to read cards with multiple steps is look for a Coma or a Period</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it is a coma, the steps happen simultaneously</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it is a period, then they happen sequentially.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SO with Entomb, Every thing is damgaed. After all the damge is delt, it checks to see if the destruction condition was met.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:18:37.801Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
