      "raw": "<p>The general way to read cards with multiple steps is look for a Coma or a Period</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it is a coma, the steps happen simultaneously</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it is a period, then they happen sequentially.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SO with Entomb, Every thing is damgaed. After all the damge is delt, it checks to see if the destruction condition was met.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
